# "Counter target spell" takes any spell, including the Impostors' controller's own, and "its controller" is then that same player (CR 701.62a): Bot1 casts
# Memnite on turn 1 and, holding the stack with Black Lotus's mana, flashes the Impostors in with Memnite on the stack to counter it. Bot1 manifests dread:
# of Plains and Forest the Plains goes face down and the Forest to the graveyard, next to the countered Memnite. Bot2 manifests nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Fear of Impostors
Memnite
Island x4
Plains
Forest
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Fear of Impostors.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Plains | Forest)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Forest; Memnite; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Plains
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
